38,1,2,talk,Rin,,But Asuka seems so serious! I think I believe her!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Minako,,"If Asuka is the Seer, the most logical move is to execute May immediately.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
