43,1,3,talk,Rin,,Maybe she's just really brave! I like that!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Minako,,"The risk of losing a villager is high, but the reward of removing the werewolf is higher.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'm inclined to trust the Seer's claim. The logic of a fake Seer claiming a target this early is less efficient.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
